    "details": {
      "description": "<p>This ramshackle cannon provides a powerful attack against the corrupted psychopomp forces in Varceta!</p><p>A player with two free hands can wield the cannon to use the FIRE!!! action.  </p><p>The Semi-Automatic Psychannon can be fired twice, and then requires three actions to reload. These actions don't need to be provided all at once, and can be provided by any adjacent creature with at least one free hand. </p><p>A creature wielding the Psychannon does not need to regrip after providing actions to reload, as normal for reload weapons. </p>",
